        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BSE100SAL, 1\" Square Wooden Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Square Wood Door Pull is available in Black Walnut, Cherry, Mahogany, and White Oak wood types. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch overall length doors pulls. The 1 Inch Square Wooden Door Handle has aluminum mounts that are available in a wide array of finish color options. If you haven't guessed yet, this First Impressions Modern Wood Door Handle is almost totally customizable because each one is handmade right here in the USA. If you don't see a finish color, wood type, or size you would like please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Modern Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BSE02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262337\"><b>First Impressions BSE100SAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BSE100012SAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BSE100024SAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BSE100036SAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Square Wood Door Pull",
                "description": "The Square Wood Door Pull is available in Black Walnut, Cherry, Mahogany, and White Oak wood types. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch overall length door pulls. The 1 Inch Square Wooden Door Handle has aluminum mounts that are available in a wide array of finish color options. If you haven't guessed yet, this First Impressions Modern Wood Door Handle is almost totally customizable because each one is handmade right here in the USA. If you don't see a finish color, wood type, or size you would like please Contact Us so we can make it for you!",
